### Hardware Required
- Arduino Mega
- Nextion Display (3.5" or 5")
- HX711 + Load Cell (5kg–20kg)
- Potentiometer (height sensor)
- Capacitive touch sensors (3x)
- SD Card Module
- ESP8266 (WiFi)
- Power Supply (5V / 2A)

### Configuration

1. Open `stunting_detection.ino`
2. Update WiFi credentials:
```cpp
char ssid[] = "your_wifi_name";
char pass[] = "your_wifi_password";
3. Update cloud server URL:
